{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00535","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 太簇角 · 卢从愿","name":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 太簇角","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坤元载物，阳乐发生。\n播殖资始，品汇咸亨。\n列俎棋布，方坛砥平。\n神歆禋祀，后德惟明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢从愿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00535.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00535","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}